# Planned baseline of persite-if-callee-loop-1000: the local property Keep hands F's parameter to a user
# callable, so the supplied G(n) stays an invocation plan. Keep is never read: the executed work is the same.
G(y) = y * 2
Pass(v) = v
F(x) = {
    Keep = Pass(x)
    if(x > 0, x, 0)
}
S(n) = n + F(G(n)) - 2 * n + 1, n < 1000

S(0).while
